      "message": "Major reason is to allow creating isAddedToSync method. updatePeriodicAdvertisementResultMap (I moved updating mSyncHandleToDeviceMap and mSyncHandleToBroadcastIdMap to updatePeriodicAdvertisementResultMap) has to be inside mSourceSyncRequestsQueue synchronization as we check broadcastId for pending/invalid sync handle in isAddedToSync.\n\nA minor reason is that I want to gather as many as possible variables, which depend on syncHandle in one place. This will enable us to make refactor and create a one object for it instead of separate variables.",
